WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.370
Act 1, Venice.

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.540
A council chamber full of powerful men.

3
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.800
A young woman rises to speak.

4
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.620
Her father is in the room.

5
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:14.790
She tells him, "I do perceive
here a divided duty:" and then,

6
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.500
"here’s my husband."

7
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.780
Act 4.

8
00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.410
The same woman sits on a bed at night.

9
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.810
Another woman takes down her hair.

10
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.680
"Prithee, unpin me" So
bold before the senate,

11
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.450
so quiet later.

12
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.120
Why won't she stand up to her husband?

13
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.940
In this mission, you'll read
her defence of her marriage,

14
00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.510
line by line.

15
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.660
You'll hear how she answers
when Othello accuses her.

16
00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.710
And you'll meet Emilia, who
speaks out when Desdemona won't.

17
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.690
Your mission: explain why
she won't defy her husband.
